- **Verdict / Controlling Rule**: SKU NM-LFP-1200W is covered by IS 16046 (Part 2): 2018 / IEC 62133-2 under BIS CRS Registration No. R-41209877, factory code Peenya-Unit-2. CPCB certificate EPR-KA-2025-08814 expires on December 31, 2026. Air Express is banned because the 1,200 Wh pack exceeds the 100 Wh IATA PI 965 exception threshold by 12x, making it UN 3480 Class 9.

- **Key Clauses & Override Mechanics**: Clause C.2 requires renewal confirmation and quarterly Form-3 recycling credit certificates by December 10, 2026. If not verified by 18:00 IST on December 10, NovaMart may auto-delist, suppress Buy-Box and inventory-freeze all Deccan battery and appliance ASINs effective December 15, 2026, without penalty or notice. Clause C.3(a) prohibits tendering or cross-docking the SKU on any Air Express or belly-cargo manifest.

- **Quantified Financial / Statutory Exposure**: Misdeclaration triggers INR 5,00,000 per-consignment liquidated indemnity plus DGCA reporting. Recall liability is uncapped, carved out from the MSA Clause 9.1 cap, backed by INR 25,00,00,000 per-occurrence insurance.

- **Required Sign-Off Gate**: Before execution, require:
  - NABL and BIS surveillance reports uploaded at least 15 days before SKU launch;
  - PRO recycler tie-ups covering 100% of FY27 collection targets;
  - surface-only dispatch at SoC ≤30% with a UN 38.3 summary attached to the e-Way Bill;
  - insurance naming NovaMart as Additional Insured and Loss Payee, with 30 days' non-cancellation.

The deal-room text contains no banking NOC or escrow requirement.
